{"version":1,"content":"<p>俄羅斯總統普京周四（22日）確認俄方準備下月10日後恢復由美國斡旋的俄烏談判，並表示未來就解決俄烏戰爭舉行的談判，應聚焦於為俄烏兩國提供安全保障，以及建立涵蓋整個歐洲的整體安全架構。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T01:23:57.446989+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:49:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T14:18:09.724821+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T01:18:01.389748+00:00","content_hash":"93f90315afbfcce9a1ba28862edd017cf756059646b9f85d661d82bfd1479912","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}